<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Banco Popular.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Banco Popular.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs downgraded Banco Popular Espanol SA to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from its &quot;recommended list&quot;.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
